### Description

This works:
```
POST _query
{
  "query": "from kibana_sample_data_logs | limit 10000",
  "filter": {
    "range": {
      "@timestamp": {
        "format": "strict_date_optional_time",
        "gte": "2023-12-12T13:00:00.000Z",
        "lt": "2023-12-12T14:00:00.000Z"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

But this returns empty values array:
```
POST _query
{
  "query": "from kibana_sample_data_logs | limit 10000",
  "filter": {
    "range": {
      "@timestamp": {
        "format": "strict_date_optional_time",
        "gte": "2023-12-12T13:00:00.000Z",
        "lt": "now"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
